Package: multiflexi-mcp-server
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends},
 python3-mcp (>= 1:2.0.0~b2),
 python3-mcp-types,
 python3-multiflexi,
 python3-pydantic (>= 2),
Provides: python3-multiflexi-mcp-server
Replaces: python3-multiflexi-mcp-server (<< 0.1.0-2~)
Breaks: python3-multiflexi-mcp-server (<< 0.1.0-2~)
Description: MCP server for MultiFlexi API integration
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes MultiFlexi job
 scheduler/middleware operations -- applications, jobs, companies, users,
 run templates, and GDPR data export -- as tools and resources for AI
 agents such as Claude Desktop and Claude Code.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-multiflexi
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.1),
 multiflexi-mcp-server (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers MultiFlexi MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for multiflexi-mcp-server. Installing it registers
 the multiflexi-mcp-server binary as an available MCP server in the
 local mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
